WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.959 --> 00:00:03.120
Hey youtubers it’s charlie.

00:00:03.120 --> 00:00:06.880
This week I asked you all to submit arrow
and flash related questions since so much

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:07.880
happened.

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:11.910
We got to meet Rashe al ghul’s other daughter
and learn all about the cast of the flash.

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:15.179
Grant gustin even trolled us with a picture
of himself wearing the suit.

00:00:15.179 --> 00:00:16.179
No joke.

00:00:16.179 --> 00:00:18.330
He posted this to his instagram.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:23.929
I ended up picking 5 questions from my Arrow
review and 5 questions from my flash preview.

00:00:23.929 --> 00:00:27.419
If you’re finding me for the first time
I do arrow Q&amp;As every week after new episodes

00:00:27.419 --> 00:00:28.419
air.

00:00:28.419 --> 00:00:29.419
Be sure to subscribe to get them!

00:00:29.419 --> 00:00:31.699
Since there’s no new episode for a couple
week’s I’ll try to think of something

00:00:31.699 --> 00:00:33.080
fun to do next week.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:34.879
Q&amp;A time, let’s go!

00:00:34.879 --> 00:00:38.860
Question Number 1 7th Element (no avatar)
asks Do you think Oliver could ever take Deathstroke

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:41.100
alone considering the Mirakuru?

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:45.550
If anyone stronger than Deathstroke reveals
themselves, how will Oliver stand up to them?

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:50.680
Two part answer, not in a fair fight he can’t.

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:55.710
The mirakuru gives Slade almost limitless
stamina, so he could just keep oliver at a

00:00:55.710 --> 00:00:56.920
stalemate until he got so fatigued he’d
start making mistakes.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:58.840
He’d only be able to get slade by tricking
him or fighting dirty.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:01.840
to the other part of your question, that’s
why they don’t have people with crazy superpowers

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:03.300
on the show.

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:15.640
It would just get ridiculous, there’d be
no way oliver could fight darkside by himself.

00:01:15.640 --> 00:01:20.170
The justice league however...

00:01:20.170 --> 00:01:24.850
Question 2 Aayush Patel asks As Flash and
Arrow TV shows are existing in the same universe,

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.259
what does it mean for Arrow's villains?

00:01:26.259 --> 00:01:29.320
Will we be seeing super-villains with actual
super powers?

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.310
And if so which ones do you reckon are likely
to appear on Arrow?

00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:34.820
I think I mentioned in my flash video, most
of the stuff on arrow including the villains

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:36.390
will stay on arrow and the flash stuff will
stay on the flash.

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:37.590
They’ve already cast villains for the flash
show.

00:01:37.590 --> 00:01:39.079
The flash villains have superpowers, and since
grant gustin has the speedforce I think that

00:01:39.079 --> 00:01:40.079
show will do actual superpowers before arrow
does.

00:01:40.079 --> 00:01:41.079
The character of the green arrow is a normal
person, so mostly you’ll see him fighting

00:01:41.079 --> 00:01:42.079
other normal non-powered villains.

00:01:42.079 --> 00:01:43.079
Batman in the movies is the same way.

00:01:43.079 --> 00:01:44.079
Human vs human.

00:01:44.079 --> 00:01:45.079
As opposed to superhuman vs superhuman.

00:01:45.079 --> 00:01:46.079
It just makes more sense on a conceptual level.

00:01:46.079 --> 00:01:47.079
Question 3 Callum Butler (no avatar) asks
I know this programme is normally at 9 on

00:01:47.079 --> 00:01:48.770
sky 1 when does it return to the UK ?

00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:54.280
The most recent listing I saw said SkyHD would
be airing episode 10 Febuary 20th, so bet

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.450
on new episodes each week after that for the
rest of the season.

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:58.189
There are 23 episodes total.

00:01:58.189 --> 00:02:03.220
Question 4 - Aymen Krist asks we saw sex scene
in the end between oli and sara ..what do

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:05.229
you expect from their relation ?﻿ (deborah
nugyen - ‘ships)

00:02:05.229 --> 00:02:12.830
I expect that 
it won’t last.

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:20.080
Dramatically it’s much more exciting to
see a hero rise than to see him just sit around

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:21.080
and be happy.

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:23.320
In order to rise you have to be struck low
by a villain.

00:02:23.320 --> 00:02:27.830
So something will happen before the end of
the season to break them up.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:29.840
I don’t know what that is, but I’m expecting
it.

00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:34.860
Question 5 - Sunny Tyler asks Birds of Prey,
So will The Huntress will be back?

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:43.120
And what about 
The Oracle?

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:51.630
Birds of Prey is episode 17, it comes right
after the suicide squad episode.

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:53.470
Huntress is coming back and she’s full on
nutters.

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:56.020
Remember how during season 1 oliver tried
to stop her from killing.

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:57.260
She’s only gotten worse since then.

00:02:57.260 --> 00:03:00.740
Her real life Helena persona is gone and she’s
just that avatar of justice now.

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:02.160
Felicity will be the oracle character.

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:06.190
Huntress will be trying to kill more people,
laurel will get in the middle and sara as

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:07.520
the canary will try to kill her to protect
laurel.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:11.980
Obviously huntress isn’t going to die, but
the birds of prey arc is going to start with

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:12.980
them at each other’s throats.

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:13.980
Literally.

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:20.290
In an interview the showrunners said that
they’re taking a multi-season arc with the

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:21.290
birds of prey.

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:25.940
So that kind of implies that caity lotz will
keep on being the canary in season 3 which

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:33.110
is awesome.

00:03:33.110 --> 00:03:37.840
That same interview says the same thing for
deathstroke.

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:39.630
So slade will be back next year too.

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:40.750
He’s slowly becoming the deathstroke from
the comic books.

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.360
and here’s where the flash questions start

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:49.270
Question 6 Shelby Larson asks My friend wants
to watch The Flash but not Arrow (I don't

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:50.270
know why)...

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:54.790
Do you think it would be possible to only
watch The Flash?/ Only watch Arrow?

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:57.530
Or do you need to see both to understand what's
going on?﻿

00:03:57.530 --> 00:04:04.830
You’re friends are silly, but yes, the flash
season 1 will be designed so that anyone can

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:07.460
jump on without reading the comics or knowing
anything about the characters.

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:10.290
Tell them to drink the arrow kool-aide.

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:11.970
(sideways mouth)

00:04:11.970 --> 00:04:16.730
Question 7 Mitchell Knights asks What will
the flash suit look like?

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:17.880
The new 52 version.

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:20.810
Or very very close to it.

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:24.669
Geoff Johns was pretty up front about them
going full on with the tv show.

00:04:24.669 --> 00:04:25.669
No holding back.

00:04:25.669 --> 00:04:29.530
No idea how the suit will work in execution.

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:38.759
I would assume he’ll befriend the vibe character
at star labs and they’ll help him design

00:04:38.759 --> 00:04:40.610
a suit that will work at superspeed.

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:45.849
Question 8 Ralph C asks about the race-bending
for the west characters and a possible wally

00:04:45.849 --> 00:04:46.849
west character.

00:04:46.849 --> 00:04:50.551
I don’t have any problem with them changing
characters when they find actors they like.

00:04:50.551 --> 00:04:51.551
They didn’t do it just to do it.

00:04:51.551 --> 00:04:53.840
Usually if they find an actor they think is
perfect they’ll just alter the character

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:54.879
to match.

00:04:54.879 --> 00:04:59.090
As for Wally West, he hasn’t been cast but
since they’re being pretty faithful to the

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:00.993
comic books I would say he’ll show up at
some point.

00:05:00.993 --> 00:05:02.409
Given the age of Barry Allen though, he’d
probably only be a little kid.

00:05:02.409 --> 00:05:06.870
Question 9 herodannyphantom asks do you think
Barry will have his own team like Oliver's

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:07.870
team arrow.﻿

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:12.060
It will be like Arrow season 1, it took oliver
most of the season to open up to diggle and

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:13.450
then later to felicity about being the vigilante.

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:16.580
And now in season 2 there’s roy and the
canary.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:18.180
So the same thing will happen with barry.

00:05:18.180 --> 00:05:20.039
First he’ll probably start on his own, then
one of his friends will find out, like detective

00:05:20.039 --> 00:05:23.110
west or Iris and then the two of them will
keep the secret from the other friend.

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:25.759
Then that friend will find out and you’ve
got your team.

00:05:25.759 --> 00:05:26.919
It’s pretty cut and dry.

00:05:26.919 --> 00:05:31.759
Question 10 Summer Bradshaw asks Hal Jordan
Green Lanter meetup, other Geoff Johns whatnot

00:05:31.759 --> 00:05:34.870
like Gorilla Grodd and the rogues gallery?

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:38.830
You had a ton of great questions so I’m
mashing up all my answers.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:47.780
No green lantern, but since it is geoff johns
doing a lot of creative, you should keep your

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:53.020
eyes peeled for easter eggs in the background.

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:57.680
As for the other villains like gorilla grodd
and the rogues gallery, they’ll do the arrow

00:05:57.680 --> 00:05:59.800
thing where one episode at a time you’ll
see them eventually.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:02.939
Gorilla grodd feels big enough to be a season
2 kind of thing.

00:06:02.939 --> 00:06:05.210
Rogues gallery, yeah definitely sometime during
season 1.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:09.979
For reference, danielle panabaker will probably
be the first supervillain he fights.

00:06:09.979 --> 00:06:15.569
If she gets her powers in the first couple
of episodes.

00:06:15.569 --> 00:06:17.250
Rick cosnett’s professor zoom character
will probably be more like slade.

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:19.479
Hide in the shadows till the end of the season.

00:06:19.479 --> 00:06:22.270
This week’s bonus question also comes from
summer (same person) other spinoffs Young

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:23.270
Justice, Suicide Squad.

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:26.830
A bunch of you have asked about spinoffs,
officially only the suicide squad has been

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:28.509
teased, but now that we have roy and slades
children will surface eventually, yes young

00:06:28.509 --> 00:06:29.509
justice will be discussed more.

00:06:29.509 --> 00:06:33.979
But if either show ends up happening it probably
wouldn’t be until flash gets a third season.

00:06:33.979 --> 00:06:34.979
So we’re talking like 2016.

00:06:34.979 --> 00:06:35.979
Which is actually the year superman vs batman
is getting released.

00:06:35.979 --> 00:06:38.360
So maybe young justice in the same year we
get a mini-justice league movie.

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:40.389
It could totally happen!

